<title>CANADA: iSTAR files for share, warrant offer.</title>
<headline>iSTAR files for share, warrant offer.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>iSTAR Internet Inc said on Tuesday it filed a preliminary prospectus for an offering of common shares and common share purchase warrants.</p>
<p>iSTAR said in a statement it filed a prospectus with the Ontario Securities Commission and will also file with securities regulators in other provinces.</p>
<p>The size of the proposed offering was not disclosed.</p>
<p>iSTAR is headquartered in Ottawa and provides Internet solutions, Web-based products and services.</p>
<p>Last week, Bank of Nova Scotia agreed to buy a 10 percent stake in iSTAR for about C$10 million.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
